{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "heading-and-unicode",
      "carve": "## Café 😀\n\nGrüße & tea.\n",
      "markdown": "## Café 😀\n\nGrüße & tea.\n",
      "djot": "## Café 😀\n\nGrüße & tea.\n",
      "rst": "Café 😀\n=======\n\nGrüße & tea.\n",
      "asciidoc": "== Café 😀\n\nGrüße & tea.\n",
      "html": "<h2>Café 😀</h2><p>Grüße &amp; tea.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "inline-structure",
      "carve": "A /word/ and *bold*, `x < y`, [link](https://example.org/a?q=1&b=2).\n",
      "markdown": "A *word* and **bold**, `x < y`, [link](https://example.org/a?q=1&b=2).\n",
      "djot": "A _word_ and *bold*, `x < y`, [link](https://example.org/a?q=1&b=2).\n",
      "rst": "A *word* and **bold**, ``x < y``, `link <https://example.org/a?q=1&b=2>`_.\n",
      "asciidoc": "A _word_ and *bold*, `x < y`, https://example.org/a?q=1&b=2[link].\n",
      "html": "<p>A <em>word</em> and <strong>bold</strong>, <code>x &lt; y</code>, <a href=\"https://example.org/a?q=1&amp;b=2\">link</a>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "loose-bullet-list",
      "carve": "- one\n\n- *two*\n",
      "markdown": "- one\n\n- **two**\n",
      "djot": "- one\n\n- *two*\n",
      "rst": "- one\n\n- **two**\n",
      "asciidoc": "* one\n\n* *two*\n",
      "html": "<ul><li><p>one</p></li><li><p><strong>two</strong></p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordered-start",
      "carve": "3. three\n\n4. four\n",
      "markdown": "3. three\n\n4. four\n",
      "djot": "3. three\n\n4. four\n",
      "rst": "3. three\n\n4. four\n",
      "asciidoc": "[start=3]\n. three\n\n. four\n",
      "html": "<ol start=\"3\"><li><p>three</p></li><li><p>four</p></li></ol>"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote",
      "carve": "> A /quote/.\n",
      "markdown": "> A *quote*.\n",
      "djot": "> A _quote_.\n",
      "rst": "    A *quote*.\n",
      "asciidoc": "[quote]\n____\nA _quote_.\n____\n",
      "html": "<blockquote><p>A <em>quote</em>.</p></blockquote>"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-block",
      "carve": "```text\na < b & c\n\nlast\n```\n",
      "markdown": "```text\na < b & c\n\nlast\n```\n",
      "djot": "```text\na < b & c\n\nlast\n```\n",
      "rst": ".. code:: text\n\n    a < b & c\n\n    last\n",
      "asciidoc": "[source,text]\n----\na < b & c\n\nlast\n----\n",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-text\">a &lt; b &amp; c\n\nlast\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "id": "thematic-break",
      "carve": "Before.\n\n---\n\nAfter.\n",
      "markdown": "Before.\n\n---\n\nAfter.\n",
      "djot": "Before.\n\n---\n\nAfter.\n",
